:"Update code quality","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":42,"deletions":39}}},{"hash":"7ef28a01f2c821d51c1d9ef797bef3ad4f2fde0a","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add assertions on Commands","messageBody":"Commands are assumed to not have CommandType of null or Unknown. It is also\nassumed that Commands have the correct information based on their CommandType.\n\nAdding assertions on these assumptions will help catch bugs in the code.\n\nLet\u0027s add assertions in the Command constructor and Laby executeCommand method.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":55,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"28889434430cdc58131d663fbc09bc9abf1f6319","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add assertions in TaskList constructor","messageBody":"TaskLists are assumed to be not null, and the tasks are assumed to be not null.\n\nAdding assertions on these assumptions will help catch bugs in the code.\n\nLet\u0027s add assertions in the TaskList constructor to ensure these assumptions are correct.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":4,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"9d1f34bb18a62b8fbf97976b3191c871c916f9fd","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add assertions in Task and extended classes constructors","messageBody":"Task descriptions are assumed to be not null and not empty.\nDeadline and Event times are assumed to be not null.\n\nAdding assertions on these assumptions will help catch bugs in the code.\n\nLet\u0027s add assertions in the Task constructor and its extended classes\nconstructors to ensure these assumptions are correct.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":11,"deletions":8}}},{"hash":"61eccd43f1e1ec52f1f4851794d46d6478c6c4cb","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Remove unused Task constructor","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":0,"deletions":9}}},{"hash":"f735bce48652f0d778fda081e7ea5b1500d0ff9e","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Fix code styles","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":9,"deletions":7}}},{"hash":"d7fc3b5dc716406e2a8f0a455190e4bc66f5f297","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Extract task parsing in Storage to Parser","messageBody":"Storage parses tasks inline in Storage.readFile.\nThis makes the code lengthy. Parsing input is better handled by Parser.\n\nLet\u0027s extract the task parsing logic from Storage.readFile() to\nParser.parseTaskFromFile().\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":59,"deletions":29}}},{"hash":"c2e6be71a52273c952e3377cb66a95e2eac41588","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Define literals in Parser","messageBody":"Parser uses some literals (eg. \"T\", \"/by\") that are not defined,\nwhich causes confusion about what they are supposed to represent.\n\nLet\u0027s define the magic literals in Parser.parseDeadline(),\nParser.parseEvent(), and Parser.parseTasksFromFile().\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":21,"deletions":10}}},{"hash":"2ae13f857eab06481fc2ed5b465f7eaec5aec8c8","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Extract parsing logic in Parser","messageBody":"Parser.parseEvent() and other task parsing methods are long\nand the happy path is not clear. The error messages have similar\nparts that are spread out in different places.\n\nLet\u0027s extract the parsing logic in Parser to more methods and\ndefine a method getErrorMessage() to pad error messages with\na standard format.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":98,"deletions":85},"md":{"insertions":11,"deletions":11}}},{"hash":"df607464267e159231ca69e3e78a943d62daf71a","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Fix code quality","messageBody":"The Laby constructor reuses tempTasks.\n\nLet\u0027s update it so that tempTasks has a clear purpose.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":3,"deletions":3}}},{"hash":"812fe20d8f75581272a305509545718230de8df8","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Combine markTask and unmarkTask in TaskList","mess